# shell: desktop
# board: both
# Two boards on one desk over two media at once: the board on the cable is
# mounted and its window rides the console link, and a second board dials
# this desktop over IP, its connection carried here by the relay from its
# own port.  The desktop listens for the second while it holds the first;
# each window comes up on the desk beside the fixture's folder, and both
# boards are mounted under /devices, the second over its connection.  This
# needs the cable board flashed with TIKU_APPL_GUI=1 TIKU_APPL_DRAW_DEMO=1
# and the dialling board with TIKU_KIT_NET_ENABLE=1
# TIKU_KITS_NET_LINK_IP_ENABLE=1 TIKU_APPL_GUI=1 TIKU_APPL_GUI_IP=1
# TIKU_APPL_DRAW_DEMO=1 (see run.sh's both lane).
wait 400
note two boards' windows are on the desktop, beside the fixture's folder
expect-windows 3
expect-title Board window
note both boards' shells are mounted, the dialling one over its connection
expect-read /devices tiku
shot /tmp/trk_boardboth.png
quit
